DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: predominantly carrying

869
01:22:08,080 --> 01:22:11,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: fixed interest rates,

870
01:22:11,080 --> 01:22:13,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: and predominantly structured

871
01:22:13,080 --> 01:22:16,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: with long repayment terms.

872
01:22:16,080 --> 01:22:17,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: First,

873
01:22:17,080 --> 01:22:20,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: 67% of our outstanding debt

874
01:22:20,080 --> 01:22:21,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: is domestic.

875
01:22:21,080 --> 01:22:23,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: This reduces our exposure

876
01:22:23,080 --> 01:22:25,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: to foreign exchange risks,

877
01:22:25,080 --> 01:22:26,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: while also supporting

878
01:22:26,080 --> 01:22:27,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: the continued development

879
01:22:27,080 --> 01:22:30,080
