884
01:22:38,080 --> 01:22:40,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: in our debt servicing costs

885
01:22:40,080 --> 01:22:43,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: and shields us from sudden increases

886
01:22:43,080 --> 01:22:48,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: or fluctuations in global interest rates.

887
01:22:48,080 --> 01:22:49,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: And third,

888
01:22:49,080 --> 01:22:52,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: 84.1% of our debt

889
01:22:52,080 --> 01:22:55,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: has long-term repayment periods,

890
01:22:55,080 --> 01:22:57,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: meaning we have several years

891
01:22:57,080 --> 01:23:00,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: before these obligations fall due.

892
01:23:00,080 --> 01:23:02,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: This longer maturity profile

893
01:23:02,080 --> 01:23:04,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: reduces our refinancing risks

894
01:23:04,080 --> 01:23:06,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: and gives us greater predictability

895
01:23:06,080 --> 01:23:09,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: in managing our debt obligations.

896
01:23:10,080 --> 01:23:13,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: This strategic borrowing mix

897
01:23:13,080 --> 01:23:15,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: by our Bureau of Treasury

898
01:23:15,080 --> 01:23:17,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: strengthens our resilience

899
01:23:17,080 --> 01:23:18,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: to external shocks

900
01:23:18,080 --> 01:23:20,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: and makes our debt obligations

901
01:23:20,080 --> 01:23:22,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: more predictable and manageable

902
01:23:22,080 --> 01:23:24,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: over the long term.

903
01:23:24,080 --> 01:23:28,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: And the market,

904
01:23:28,080 --> 01:23:30,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: the global markets assessment

905
01:23:30,080 --> 01:23:31,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: of our fiscal fundamentals

906
01:23:31,080 --> 01:23:33,080
DOF Secretary Frederick D. Go: is also reflected

